{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56676","headline":"五言诗 一 · 无名氏","name":"五言诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春水春池满，春时春草生。\n春人饮春酒，春鸟哢春声。\n（见《文物》一九七二年第三期刊李知宴《唐代瓷窰概况与唐瓷的分期》引，系「无产阶级文化大革命中出土文物展览」在湖南展出的一件长沙窰壸腹部所题诗。\n伯三五九七卷收此诗，前二句作「春日春风动，春来春草生」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}